{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0FuaW1hdGlvbi8yMDExLS0yMDIwL0ElMjBTdG9yayUyN3MlMjBKb3VybmV5JTIwJTI4MjAxNyUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"A Stork's Journey","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/aKwgGlhdhdbx0duJhCRojkEZXgU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8SjSMwj3CyFvIYVJ7qX6UnPRzsw.jpg","description":"Orphaned at birth and raised by storks, teenage sparrow Richard believes he is one of them. But when time comes to migrate to Africa, his stork family is forced to reveal his true identity and leave him behind in the forest, since he is not a migratory bird and would not survive the journey. Determined to prove he is a stork after all, Richard ventures south on his own. But only with the help of Olga, an eccentric owl with an imaginary friend and Kiki, a narcissistic, disco-singing parakeet, does he stand a chance to reach his goal and learn to accept who he really is.\n\nRated PG · Released 28 Apr 2017 · Belgium, Germany · Language: German · 85 min\nStudio: Walking The Dog, Den Siste Skilling, Knudsen & Streuber Medienmanufaktur\n\nOn your server — Audio: German","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Animation","Family","Fantasy","Adventure","Animation"],"imdbRating":"6.1","imdb_id":"tt3823116","moviedb_id":378111,"tmdbId":378111,"runtime":"85 min","cast":["Christian Gaul","Tilman Döbler","Nicolette Krebitz","Maud Ackermann","Schroeder Kacmar","Marco Eßer","Marc Thompson","Marcus Off"],"director":["Toby Genkel"],"writer":["Reza Memari"],"released":"2017-04-28T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Their adventure is the destination.","country":"Belgium, Germany, Luxembourg","language":"German","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Toby Genkel","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/AfUC2tx0ZATPCyRMGgDnVkXgTQY.jpg"},{"name":"Christian Gaul","character":"Kiki (voice)"},{"name":"Tilman Döbler","character":"Richard (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jtbks49bW41K4USfvLN6KzZt0nN.jpg"},{"name":"Nicolette Kre